00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:20.960
repeatable approach, screen for companies that pair rapid revenue expansion with accelerating

00:02:20.960 --> 00:02:26.740
shareholder distributions rather than hoarding cash. Investors can implement this by pulling

00:02:26.740 --> 00:02:32.800
quarterly free cash flow trends and dividend growth rates in a screener, then comparing payout

00:02:32.800 --> 00:02:39.000
