00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:45.500
multi-year AI buildouts. It carries risk when growth slows and the market reprices high multiples.

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:51.080
Always verify the sustainability of the payout increase against the underlying earnings trajectory

00:02:51.080 --> 00:02:58.020
before adding exposure. If you want to try this filter in your TFSA, start with a simple screen

00:02:58.020 --> 00:03:04.420
that flags names showing both top-line growth above 15% and dividend hikes in the last two quarters.

00:03:05.060 --> 00:03:09.820
This approach rewards patience because the real compounding comes from letting both the business

00:03:09.820 --> 00:03:16.200
and the payout grow together over several years. Disclaimer, this is a simulated trade for educational

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:23.460
purposes only. No real money is involved. This is not financial advice. Today's practice investment

