00:05:24.240 --> 00:05:29.700
What this teaches us is to always require volume confirmation above the 20-day average before

00:05:29.700 --> 00:05:36.580
entering momentum trades on policy-driven catalysts. That volume discipline keeps us from chasing headlines

00:05:36.580 --> 00:05:42.380
without confirming that real participation supports the move. Wealth's simple is expanding

